  <!--原中文: '信念法球', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Orb Of Conviction',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Orb Of Conviction-->
  <TM_Artifact_OrbOfConviction.label>信念法球</TM_Artifact_OrbOfConviction.label>
  <!--原中文: '也被称为叛徒的小饰品，精神错乱的宝珠，和盗取心灵的贼-信念法球是一个强大而危险的神器。当充满了施法者的信念和魔法时，它可以用在另一个施法者身上。如果成功，目标将立即加入施法者派系，但会受到心灵冲击的影响。只有最强大的法师才能使用这个神器的力量，即使那样，它也会付出沉重的代价。法术施放后，球体将内爆，只能使用一次。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Also known as the Traitors Trinket, Orb of Insanity, and Mind Thief - the Orb of Conviction is a powerful and dangerous artifact. When filled with the conviction and magic of a caster, it can be used to press that conviction upon another.
	
If successful, the target will immediately join the casters faction, but will be affected by psychic shock.

Only the most powerful mages can direct the power of this artifact; even then, it will exact a heavy price. The orb will implode once the spell has been cast and can only be used once.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Also known as the Traitors Trinket, Orb of Insanity, and Mind Thief - the Orb of Conviction is a powerful and dangerous artifact. When filled with the conviction and magic of a caster, it can be used to press that conviction upon another.
	
If successful, the target will immediately join the casters faction, but will be affected by psychic shock.

Only the most powerful mages can direct the power of this artifact; even then, it will exact a heavy price. The orb will implode once the spell has been cast and can only be used once.-->
  <TM_Artifact_OrbOfConviction.description>也被称为叛徒的小饰品，精神错乱的宝珠，和盗取心灵的贼-信念法球是一个强大而危险的神器。当充满了施法者的信念和魔法时，它可以用在另一个施法者身上。如果成功，目标将立即加入施法者派系，但会受到心灵冲击的影响。只有最强大的法师才能使用这个神器的力量，即使那样，它也会付出沉重的代价。法术施放后，球体将内爆，只能使用一次。</TM_Artifact_OrbOfConviction.description>
