  <TM_Artifact_NecroticOrb.label>死灵宝珠</TM_Artifact_NecroticOrb.label>
  <!--原中文: '一种神器，能够容纳维持不死生物所需的法力。死灵宝珠的功能很像一个电池；当它被一个亡灵装备时，它从一个死灵法师身上吸收能量，就好像它也是一个不死生物一样。当亡灵法师没有能量时，它会分散能量来维持亡灵。\n一个亡灵只能装备一个球。死灵宝珠只有在装备时才会生效。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An artifact that enhances the necrotic energy required to sustain the undead. The Necrotic Orb functions much like a battery; when equipped by a pawn that is sustaining undead, it absorbs energy from a necromancer as if it were an undead itself, however, it also reduces the total upkeep cost to sustain undead by 25%. When no energy is available from a necromancer, it will disperse energy to sustain undead.
	
